claim.claim-text:
a rotatable screw member (552) having a screw head (556) and a screw body (564) projecting distally from the screw head (556) along a longitudinal axis (557) to a screw distal end (568), the screw body (564) comprising a non-threaded lag zone (560) and a threaded engagement zone (558);
a washer member (554) having a proximal side (570) and a distal side (572), wherein the screw head (556) is received in the washer member (554); and
a fusion zone (565) having a length which is measured from the distal side (572) of the washer member (554) to a proximal end of the threaded engagement zone (558), wherein the length of the implant fusion zone (565) ranges from about 10 mm to about 26 mm,
wherein the threaded engagement zone (558) is configured to be inserted through the first bone portion (6) and into the cavity (20) and to engage with the second bone portion (5);
the non-threaded lag zone (560) is configured to be positioned within the cavity (20);
the screw member (552) is configured so that rotation of the screw member (552) compresses the joint (2); and
the washer member (554) is configured to be angled with respect to the screw member (552) to permit maximum surface contact of the distal side (572) of the washer member (554) with the first bone portion (6).
